<title>AUSTRALIA: Sydney Futures Exchange wheat futures up slightly.</title>
<headline>Sydney Futures Exchange wheat futures up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Traded Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat  futures rose slightly on Friday with the January contract jumping  A$2.00 to A$196.00 a tonne on a volume of four lots. Settlement prices  for the untraded contracts were mixed.</p>
